#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RHEL-Install-RPMs.rst:12
msgid ""
"RPM packages for ROS 2 Rolling Ridley are currently available for RHEL 10. "
"The Rolling Ridley distribution will change target platforms from time to "
"time as new platforms are selected for development. The target platforms are "
"defined in `REP 2000 <https://reps.openrobotics.org/rep-2000/>`__. Most "
"people will want to use a stable ROS distribution."
msgstr ""

